sequenceDiagram
    participant TOP as TOPSSIM Domain
    participant HPLMN as HPLMN<br/>H-NRF/H-UDM/H-UDR
    participant RCF
    participant SDMCF as SDM-CF
    participant UE as UE / gNB
    participant VAMF as V-AMF
    participant VSMF as V-SMF

    %% Profile-focused TOPSSIM baseline.
    %% Runtime procedures remain standard; only profile/discovery acceleration is expanded.

    rect rgb(232,245,255)
    note over TOP,VSMF: Phase 0 - Before roaming/runtime: prepare profile and discovery answers
    TOP->>HPLMN: Nnrf_NFDiscovery + authorized Nudm_SDM GET<br/>am-data, smf-select-data, sm-data
    HPLMN-->>TOP: Authorized SDM profile data<br/>and producer metadata
    TOP->>SDMCF: Install PreparedSdmProfile<br/>AM data, SMF selection data, SM data
    TOP->>RCF: Install DiscoveryCacheEntry / UDM_ROUTE_ENTRY<br/>route Nudm_SDM to SDM-CF
    end

    rect rgb(245,255,245)
    note over TOP,VSMF: Phase 1 - Registration: AM profile served locally by SDM-CF
    UE->>VAMF: Registration procedure starts

    VAMF->>RCF: Nnrf_NFDiscovery<br/>Find UDM for Nudm_SDM
    RCF-->>VAMF: SDM-CF as UDM-compatible producer

    VAMF->>SDMCF: Nudm_SDM GET<br/>am-data
    SDMCF-->>VAMF: prepared am-data<br/>UE-AMBR, RFSP, subscribed NSSAI refs

    VAMF->>SDMCF: Nudm_SDM GET<br/>smf-select-data
    SDMCF-->>VAMF: prepared smf-select-data<br/>DNN infos, S-NSSAI, roaming constraints

    UE-->>VAMF: Registration completes
    end

    rect rgb(245,255,245)
    note over TOP,VSMF: Phase 2 - PDU Session: SM profile served locally if in TOPSSIM scope
    UE->>VAMF: PDU Session Establishment starts<br/>DNN, S-NSSAI

    VAMF->>RCF: Nnrf_NFDiscovery<br/>Find SMF for Nsmf_PDUSession
    RCF-->>VAMF: prepared V-SMF discovery result
    VAMF->>VSMF: Create SM context<br/>profile lookup delegated to SMF

    VSMF->>RCF: Nnrf_NFDiscovery<br/>Find UDM for Nudm_SDM
    RCF-->>VSMF: SDM-CF as UDM-compatible producer

    VSMF->>SDMCF: Nudm_SDM GET<br/>sm-data for DNN + S-NSSAI + serving PLMN
    SDMCF-->>VSMF: prepared sm-data<br/>QoS, Session-AMBR, PDU type, static IP

    VSMF-->>UE: PDU session completes
    end
